### No token → 401
GET http://localhost:3000/whoami

### Valid token → 200 with your claims
GET http://localhost:3000/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tampered token → 401 (change one character in the middle of the token)
GET http://localhost:3000/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x

### Public endpoint still works without a token
GET http://localhost:3000/health